# Local annotations, never in the repo.
.internal/

# Sources somebody sent in to look at, which are not ours to redistribute.
# slow.asm is a 419 KB Z80 program that came with a report that zap was
# slower on it than ez80asm; it stays out of the repository until whoever
# wrote it says otherwise.
#
# Nothing is lost by keeping it out. `test/corpus.sh slow.asm` compares it
# against the reference the same way the vendored sources are compared, and
# `test/bench/time-one.sh bin/zap.bin slow.asm` times it on the Agon -- both
# take a path, so a file sitting here is measured without being committed.
slow.asm
slow-zap.jpeg
*.local.s
*.local.asm

# Binaries built to answer one question, and the pictures that came with it.
hwprofile/
